      "widgets_values": [
        "## krea2_int8_lora4\n\n- diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_bf16.safetensors\n- vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n\nLoRA slots (loras/, model-only, chained in order):\n1. `krea2_darkbrush.safetensors` \u2014 trigger `monochrome ink wash style`, strength 0.8\n2. `krea2_dotmatrix.safetensors` \u2014 trigger `monochrome stippling style`, strength 0.6\n3. `krea2_kidsdrawing.safetensors` \u2014 trigger `naive expressive sketch style`, strength 0.6\n4. `krea2_neondrip.safetensors` \u2014 trigger `textured abstract style`, strength 0.6\n\nStacked styles fight each other \u2014 retune strengths per pair.\n\nSource: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2 (diffusion_models/, text_encoders/, vae/, loras/)."
      ],
